modate a traditional two-lot subdivision or other custom infill dreams. The existing 1.5-storey home retains vintage elements like real hardwood and historic windows, but requires major rehabilitation. This is an extraordinary footprint in one of Edmonton’s most treasured heritage communities. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$447,700"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,206 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,510 sq ft"],["Year built","1918"],["Storeys","1.5"],["Neighbourhood","Highlands"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5W3K8"],["MLS® number","E4516465"],["Listed","November 13, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Stove, Dryer"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Partially finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.20 m × 3.38 m (13'9\" × 11'1\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.83 m × 3.53 m (12'7\" × 11'7\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.75 m × 4.36 m (15'7\" × 14'4\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.36 m × 3.38 m (11'0\" × 11'1\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","4.20 m × 2.65 m (13'9\" × 8'8\")"]],"courtesy":"Wendi Darling, Century 21 Masters","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"highlands","area":"northeast-edmonton"}